{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19858","headline":"劝酒 · 孟郊","name":"劝酒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白日无定影，清江无定波。\n人无百年寿，百年复如何。\n堂上陈美酒，堂下列清歌。\n劝君今曲巵，勿谓朱颜酡。\n松栢岁岁茂，丘陵日日多。\n君看终南山，千古青峨峨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}